==Description==
The '''Blood Moon Nametag''' is a nametag that could have been obtained at Level 14 of the regular [[Null & Void Event#Null & Void Battle Pass|Null & Void Battle Pass]] track. At that Level, it had a cost of {{GumDrops|315}} or {{Robux|39}} to unlock it, with a total cost of {{GumDrops|2,105}} or {{Robux|626}}. Prior to the 20% discount, it had a cost of {{Robux|44}} to unlock it, with a total cost of {{Robux|791}}.

The '''Blood Moon Nametag''' has a red to purple gradient text with a black outline. It features a red moon, possibly in a [[wikipedia:Lunar eclipse|Lunar Eclipse]], alongside black clouds surrounding the username of the player. There are also particles emitted from these clouds. 

